    Alvarado\n\nMusic:\nTurosu \n\nRinako VA:\nMoon Raye\n\nSFX:\nAnnoyed_Spy\n\nInvited
    Engimono Artists:\nFiorellarts / Ani-Myruuu / Zikuuul\n\nGraffiti Artists:\nPipopsicle
    / Temorinki / Josh_Reptiliano / Moge Market / DoffitoK / Turosu / Leaf Arrow
    / ToquedeMidas / Ratawa / ItsMarimaru / Neometal / Skeletontaaa / Kidd.Ketchup
    / Elito / Kotico.png \n\nSpecial thanks to:\nXelaon, Otasan (Ontako), Professor
    Pablo & Walter."
